# Purpose
One guide for the shared task list people and agents use for work that
outlives a turn.

# Sanitization
Written fresh from the engine contract and authorization code
(rewrite-only): no service names, routes, ports, stores or error codes.

# Gotchas
- AI and script tasks do NOT start by themselves; keep the bold warning while
  that is true. Update it in the same change that turns runs on.
- The permission table mirrors the engine's single authorization function
  (org: members read, admins manage, assigned member acts; mesh: mesh
  admins manage, assigned mesh member acts; node follows mesh plus node
  owners/admins; private: creator manages, creator and assignee act).
- Schedule limits: lead time 15 min to 7 days (12 h default), catch-up all
  capped at 7, rules DAILY/WEEKLY(BYDAY)/MONTHLY(BYMONTHDAY), interval ≤99.

# Change History
